      "type": "knowledge",
      "title": "Python 列表 (List)",
      "content": "列表是有序的可变序列，支持增删改查。\n\n• 创建：lst = [1, 2, 3]\n• 追加：lst.append(4)\n• 切片：lst[1:3]\n• 长度：len(lst)\n• 排序：lst.sort() 或 sorted(lst)",
      "tags": ["记忆卡片", "数据类型", "容器"],
      "chapter": "基础语法",
      "difficulty": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "knowledge",
      "title": "Python 字典 (Dict)",
      "content": "字典是键值对集合（Python 3.7+ 保持插入顺序）。\n\n• 创建：d = {'key': 'value'}\n• 访问：d['key'] 或 d.get('key', default)\n• 遍历：for k, v in d.items():\n• 存在检查：'key' in d\n• 删除：del d['key']",
      "tags": ["记忆卡片", "数据类型", "容器"],
      "chapter": "基础语法",
      "difficulty": 2
    },
